~ start
Old Delver: Back from the dark, or only on your way down?
- What lies below?
	Old Delver: Slimes near the top, bones further down, and living embers deepest of all. The deeper you go, the harder they hit.
	=> start
- Any advice?
	Old Delver: Rest by the fire before you go, buy potions from the merchant, and climb back up while you still can.
	=> start
- Farewell.
	Old Delver: Mind the embers.
	=> END
